.com/projects...ms/description</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":9511,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9511-sirlol","user":"SirLOL","date":".  Clarification. 11-19-2015, 05:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9511-sirlol","name":"SirLOL","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9511_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-19T15:46:27-08:00","id":769603,"title":"","content":"Here is the kickstarter<br /> <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/beast-the-primordial-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects...estige-edition</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8","name":"reaperfrost8","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar893_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-19T15:56:23-08:00","id":769604,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar893_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"893\" data-vbnamecard=\"893\">reaperfrost8</a> thanks for the link. However I know a McFarland or two from AR. LOL Second, its seems... a little boxed in. Is that all there is to the game? It seems only a small aspect of a side of a tale yet to be told. I say this, because, my game is ALLOT more open. This aspect is only a small portion to what can be done in my game. HOWEVER I don't have THAT much detail in that particular avenue. Beast, could be used as a sort of plug in quite easily. Nevertheless I am looking forward to the idea and such. It seems like a worthy adventure. In the end I might not care for it, however, I think I might could enjoy the journey, if I live that long. LOL. Again thanks for your time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9511-sirlol","name":"SirLOL","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9511_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-19T15:59:38-08:00","id":769607,"title":"","content":"Actually they released a demo of the game unfortunately this is the old draft and not the latest one.<br /> <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;source=web&amp;rct=j&amp;url=https://img.4plebs.org/boards/tg/image/1434/25/1434256608427.pdf&amp;ved=0ahUKEwiGk6Gt2J3JAhVCpIgKHcpmCRQQFggbMAA&amp;usg=AFQjCNFD34C5FWVNdxArLSSpL54icl-RAA&amp;sig2=k2tHJwU3_gaaa97sDUBxhw\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;sour..._gaaa97sDUBxhw</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8","name":"reaperfrost8","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar893_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-19T16:43:19-08:00","id":769629,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar893_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"893\" data-vbnamecard=\"893\">reaperfrost8</a> It seems so familiar, like I seen it before...I don't think me playing this game is a good thing for me. I will tell you why, and its not something I am proud of. I know what part of me is a monster, and its unlike any I have seen in an horror show. Cold, calculating, and patient, and waiting for decades for the perfect wine of vengeance to age. To literally take someone's spirit/soul, or make them willingly forfeit it. Blood prices have been paid heavily for hurting what's mine or what I hold dear. I have to do nothing but set back and let it happen. I might say a price must be paid. That's about it however. I found out, at a young age, that I am a natural summoner/enchanter. I have to keep focus in order to just keep the bad away, so it seems. Where there is great light, there is a great shadow, on this world, yet not in all worlds/dimensions/modes of thoughts etc.I have seen a great light, that reveals my darkness for me to purge, and I am still working on it. I could play that game with ease of mastery, spinning my tale my yarn, like a long noodle sucked up like a worm, little sparrow, only to lead to my hungry maw. I also knew of a person who lived like this for a long time, and was quite proficient at it. Who knew at least 40 languages and had an iq well over 200. This person was unusually long lived, and quick and accurate...and I still don't really think that he died...just went back into hiding to continue, maybe, to make the world a better place, no matter what he had to do...not sure but that dude creeped me out. He did protect me from idiots for a time, and was good at it. Somehow could make a company disappear over night, no records on the internet or otherwise. ANYWAY I am done talking about that, its just creepy. I open up easy and write allot with out even trying. ALL THIS solidifies why I am a Christian, trying to be anyway, not perfect and nor do I pretend to be. What I have read and understood, tells more than what most are willing to preach/ or teach. Even to the telling of such matters afore mentioned, if you know how to understand what your reading and why it was wrote that way in the original tounge.<br /> Good night friend, and thanks for your kindness and consistency.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9511-sirlol","name":"SirLOL","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9511_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-19T17:37:30-08:00","id":769667,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SirLOL</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/769515-beast-the-primordial-what-is-it-where-to-get-the-details#post769515\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Subject nuff said.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UYx9NdyFI00\" data-code=\"UYx9NdyFI00\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/UYx9NdyFI00/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Sadly the music drowns out the audio half way through the video, but that's the trailer for the game.<br /> <br /> As for you knowing what kind of monster you are, I think you're looking at the families for their face value. Giants represent the fear of weakness, Kraken represent the fear of the depths, Gorgons represent the fear of appearance. But that doesn't automatically mean &quot;Muscle, Water, Ugly&quot; when dealing with them. Expand your horizons and look at them from a metaphorical point of view and there are many different ways you can play them. The Giant might be the head of a big name corporation that muscles smaller businesses out of the area so it can expand. During a Batman thread, we suggested the Joker was a Kraken because of how deep his insanity goes. A Gorgon could be one of those people you see on informative murder porn shows who lure victims in with their beauty and charm, only to destroy them once they fall for the trap.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 11-19-2015, 08:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-20T06:27:17-08:00","id":769921,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SirLOL</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/769515-beast-the-primordial-what-is-it-where-to-get-the-details?p=769629#post769629\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar893_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"893\" data-vbnamecard=\"893\">reaperfrost8</a> It seems so familiar, like I seen it before...</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, the game does have some elements similar to games like <b>Changeling</b>, <b>Nobilis</b>, and <b>Whispering Vault</b>, if that helps any.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I don't think me playing this game is a good thing for me. I will tell you why, and its not something I am proud of. I know what part of me is a monster, and its unlike any I have seen in an horror show. Cold, calculating, and patient, and waiting for decades for the perfect wine of vengeance to age. To literally take someone's spirit/soul, or make them willingly forfeit it. Blood prices have been paid heavily for hurting what's mine or what I hold dear. I have to do nothing but set back and let it happen. . . . </div> </div> </div>Well, a Beast certainly <i>can</i> feed that way . . .but that's not the only way. <br /> <br /> One of the key themes in the game, at least in the original draft, was &quot;what makes a monster, and what makes a man?&quot; Is the villain of the story the Beast, a primordial horror reborn in human flesh, who decides to only eat child molesters, and volunteers in a soup kitchen on the weekend? Or is it the Hero, <i>technically</i> a human, who burns down an orphanage to kill said Beast?<br /> <br /> Another big theme is &quot;Family&quot;. Beasts consider all the other supernaturals (<i>except</i> the angels &amp; demons created by the God-Machine) to be kin . . . and has powers that certainly suggest some ties. The ability to find the others, pass themselves off as one of their &quot;cousins&quot;, boost powers . . . They're even immune to Disquiet, which drives people to murder Prometheans. And the rules explicitly encourage Beasts to build a &quot;family&quot;, bringing in the outcasts of the other splats.<br /> <br /> So you can play the game as a straight-up monster rampage - or you can go deeper, if you want <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4624-one-vorlon","name":"One Vorlon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"537"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-20T16:10:30-08:00","id":770358,"title":"","content":"Thank you for your love and support. I am VERY introspective, possibly the most you will ever meet. That being said, I know what my darkside is. Its rage, anger, and fear of loosing what is sacred, like the natural order flora/fauna of the planet, The fear and anger of those who corrupt The intelligent child like innocence. The beast is like an cross between a raging bull and a ravenous werewolf. Caged deep within my primordial black forest, trying to starve it if idiot people will quit feeding it....<br /> <br /> I definitely like your input, thanks people.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9511-sirlol","name":"SirLOL","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9511_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}